.TH MYGREP 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search a file for matching text
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.PP
.B int mygrep(const char *filename, const char *pattern);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mygrep
searches the specified file for occurrences of the given pattern.
Matching lines are reported when the pattern is found.
The function returns a value indicating the result of the search.
